      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Columbia%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1945, California created Columbia State Historic Park from the town’s remaining historic buildings.",
